@startuml review-sequence
title UC06 — Review Pull Request (W14-01)
hide footbox
skinparam sequenceMessageTextAlignment center

actor "Reviewer\n(Developer)" as R
participant "Laravel API" as API
database "MySQL" as DB
participant "GitHubService\n(adapter)" as GH
participant "GitHub REST API" as GIT

== Prasyarat ==
R -> API: POST /api/v1/pull-requests/{id}/reviews\n{decision: approve|request_changes, comment?}
activate API
API -> API: Validasi FormRequest\n(422 VALIDATION_ERROR bila gagal)
API -> DB: SELECT PR (id)
API -> API: 404 PULL_REQUEST_NOT_FOUND bila tidak ada\n403 REVIEW_AUTHOR_NOT_ALLOWED bila reviewer = penulis\n409 PULL_REQUEST_NOT_OPEN bila status bukan Open

== Transaksi 1 — cadangkan review ==
API -> DB: BEGIN
API -> DB: SELECT PR ... FOR UPDATE (lockForUpdate)
API -> DB: UPSERT code_review\n(sync_status=pending, menggantikan\nreview lama reviewer sama)
API -> DB: COMMIT

== Sinkronisasi ke GitHub ==
API -> GH: createPullRequestReview(number, event, body)
activate GH
GH -> GIT: POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/{number}/reviews
GIT --> GH: 200/201 {id, state, submitted_at} | error
deactivate GH

alt Sinkronisasi sukses
    API -> DB: BEGIN
    API -> DB: SELECT PR ... FOR UPDATE
    API -> DB: bila review_state masih pending:\n  review.sync_status=synced, synced_at\n  PR.review_state = approved|changes_requested
    opt decision = request_changes
        API -> DB: UPDATE maintenance_backlog\nstatus = 'Sedang Dikerjakan' (BR-20)
    end
    API -> DB: COMMIT
    API --> R: 200 {message: "...disetujui..." /\n"Perubahan memerlukan perbaikan.",\nmeta.sync.status=synced}
else Sinkronisasi gagal
    API -> DB: BEGIN
    API -> DB: review.sync_status=gagal,\nlast_sync_error_code
    API -> DB: COMMIT\n(PR tetap Open, review_state tetap pending)
    API --> R: 200 + peringatan meta.sync={status:gagal}\n(review tersimpan, keputusan belum berlaku)
end
deactivate API

== Setelah approve (di luar W14-01) ==
note over API, GIT
  Status backlog 'Selesai' hanya saat sinkronisasi GitHub
  melaporkan PR merged (BR-22, FR-UC06-16).
  Ready for Merge = label tampilan saat review_state=approved.
end note
@enduml
